      "name": "dsh-tool-call-repair",
      "title": {
        "en": "dsh-tool-call-repair",
        "zh": "dsh-tool-call-repair"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Keeps a turn alive when a model request fails recoverably: any failure code is retried with exponential backoff under a bounded budget, so transient gateway faults (truncated tool arguments, empty completions, early stream ends) do not end the task. Toggleable from the plugin manager."
      },
